{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to a game that won\u2019t go easy on you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a bald guy with a pogo stick and a set of questionable life choices.<br>Armed with stubbornness and optimism that fades faster than your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a climb where every mistake is a ticket back down.<br>And if you fall \u2014 don\u2019t worry, the mountain isn\u2019t going anywhere.<br>It patiently waits to greet you at the bottom again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1 <strong>Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fully mouse-based. <br>\u2022 It\u2019s convenient until the moment you realize the mouse is your biggest enemy. <br>\u2022 Wrong angle \u2014 you fall. <br>\u2022 Hand twitched \u2014 you fall. <br>\u2022 Thought about food \u2014 still fall. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/ea7b7b6380b39ccbf5988b516fcd9708.poster.avif?t=1764316289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/ea7b7b6380b39ccbf5988b516fcd9708.webm?t=1764316289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/ea7b7b6380b39ccbf5988b516fcd9708.mp4?t=1764316289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u2699 <strong>Features </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 \ud83e\udde0 <strong>Skill growth</strong> \u2014 the game doesn\u2019t get easier; you just get used to the suffering. <br>\u2022 \u26f0 <strong>A route full of surprises</strong> \u2014 sometimes pleasant, usually not. <br>\u2022 \ud83d\ude24 <strong>Physics</strong> that work perfectly\u2026 until they start working against you. <br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfa2 <strong>Emotional rollercoaster</strong> \u2014 every climb is triumph, every fall is philosophy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/0473a839ebfdacc2593a3258c3884139.poster.avif?t=1764316289\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/0473a839ebfdacc2593a3258c3884139.webm?t=1764316289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/extras/0473a839ebfdacc2593a3258c3884139.mp4?t=1764316289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 <strong>Multiplayer (even worse)</strong><br><br>If you want to feel true disappointment in humanity \u2014 invite your friends. <br>\ud83d\udc65 Up to 4 players, each guaranteed to ruin your jump. <br>\ud83c\udf00 Two skills: <br>\u2022 <strong>Pull</strong> \u2014 drag a friend closer so you both fall together. <br>\u2022 <strong>Push</strong> \u2014 launch your buddy into orbit so he can rethink his life mid-air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The multiplayer atmosphere is always friendly.<br>Well\u2026 <i>in theory.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Goal</strong><br><br>Your goal is simple: <strong>climb.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Main Question</strong><br><br><strong>Will you reach the top?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3663980/e10c0ca0e034a1c0edb39ffb10bcbf85d8501e65.jpg"},{"name":"Path of the Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3663980/7ffbfa7ef4cecff5c09220492885fb30c70143a4.jpg"},{"name":"Path of the Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3663980/4ed8d1d7bd0b7374f533c4c105fc11bca0e64617.jpg"},{"name":"Master Sensei","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3663980/8bdea2db483ab51cc0df36609f736c9207500dda.jpg"},{"name":"Finish with Applause","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3663980/3f2242a21ccb72554a9863b4c297f50baa84b39a.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3663980?t=1764316289","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3663980?t=1764316289","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/df632b67fde828d2f6d56b827cfe0e30b7c62d9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764316289","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3663980/df632b67fde828d2f6d56b827cfe0e30b7c62d9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764316289","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to a game that won\u2019t go easy on you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a bald guy with a pogo stick and a set of questionable life choices.<br>Armed with stubbornness and optimism that fades faster than your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a climb where every mistake is a ticket back down.<br>And if you fall \u2014 don\u2019t worry, the mountain isn\u2019t going anywhere.<br>It patiently waits to greet you at the bottom again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddb1 <strong>Control</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Fully mouse-based. <br>\u2022 It\u2019s convenient until the moment you realize the mouse is your biggest enemy. <br>\u2022 Wrong angle